# Level 2 (planet 2): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots (or not) and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. The formation of eight parts 33-40, the green creatures 43-46, the
# large creatures 21 with their thrusters, and the drone generators 4B and 4C.
level 2
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
